<main class="content">
  <div class="container-fluid">
    <div class="header">
      <h1 class="header-title">Confirm Clone</h1>
      <nav aria-label="breadcrumb">
        <ol class="breadcrumb">
          <li class="breadcrumb-item"><%= link_to "Dashboard", dashboards_path %></li>
          <li class="breadcrumb-item"><%= link_to "Proposal Types", proposal_types_path %></li>
          <li class="breadcrumb-item"><%= link_to @proposal_type.name, proposal_type_proposal_forms_path(@proposal_type) %></li>
          <li class="breadcrumb-item active">Confirm Clone</li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-8">
      <div class="alert alert-info" role="alert">
        <strong>You are about to clone an active form.</strong>
      </div>

      <div class="card mb-3">
        <div class="card-body">
          <p>Cloning <strong><%= @proposal_form.title %></strong> (ID #<%= @proposal_form.id %>) will create a new <strong>draft</strong> copy. The original form will remain active and unchanged.</p>
          <p class="mb-0">You are responsible for managing the original form after cloning. In particular:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 mb-0">
            <li>Any draft proposals tied to the original form will remain attached to it — they will <strong>not</strong> be moved to the clone automatically.</li>
            <li>When you are ready to retire the original form, use the <strong>Deactivate</strong> button on it. That step will give you the option to migrate or lock any remaining draft proposals.</li>
            <li>New proposals will continue to use the original (active) form until you activate the clone and deactivate the original.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <%= form_with url: @confirm_url, method: @confirm_method, data: { turbo: false } do |f| %>
        <%= hidden_field_tag :confirmed, 1 %>
        <% (@clone_params || {}).each do |key, value| %>
          <%= hidden_field_tag key, value %>
        <% end %>
        <div class="d-flex gap-2">
          <%= f.submit "Proceed — create draft clone", class: 'btn btn-primary' %>
          <%= link_to "Cancel", proposal_type_proposal_forms_path(@proposal_type), class: 'btn btn-secondary' %>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
